{
  "id": "kings_nib_talk",
  "start": "greet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greet",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "A taproom with an ox's yoke over the fire and a landlord who has seen you look at it."
        },
        {
          "text": "“Go on then. Get it out of the way.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "kings_nib_ox",
          "text": "How does an ox drown in eleven inches of water?",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "kings_ford_ox"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                11,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_crown",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "kings_nib_ox_told",
            "onFailure": "kings_nib_ox_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "kings_nib_keeper",
          "text": "Who keeps the sluice house?",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "kings_ford_keeper"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                10,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_crown",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "kings_nib_keeper_told",
            "onFailure": "kings_nib_keeper_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "greet_leave",
          "text": "Nothing.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "kings_nib_ox_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“It does not.” He says it before you have finished. “That is the joke and that is also the answer. It is in the parish register — drowned at the ford, and the ford is eleven inches, and it was eleven inches that year because the sluice was down.” He wipes the counter. “Somebody wrote *drowned* because there was no other word for what they found.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "kings_ford_ox"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "kings_nib_ox_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "kings_nib_ox_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_crown",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "kings_nib_ox_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "kings_nib_keeper_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Nobody. Ninety years, nobody.” He shrugs. “There is a keeper's cottage on the end of it with a roof on it and a door that shuts, and the parish has not paid a keeper since my grandfather. Make of that what you like. Most people make nothing of it, which is restful.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
